# Location pages

Use `LocationPlanPage`. Follow `docs/location-page-pattern.md`. Site hierarchy is `docs/site.md`.

Alice Springs (`app/australia/alice-springs/page.tsx`) is the approved reference.

- Desktop vibe bar: proportional chronological strip.
- Mobile vibe bar: compact labeled map (`mapLabel`, horizontal) plus stacked cards. Do not use swipe-to-scroll blocks.
- Work & School blocks: up to four linked weekday ideas. Hover/focus preview; touch opens the bottom sheet.
- Pair Work & School and Where to Stay. Vacation stops may replace Work & School with a logistics box.
- Put special weekends in `featurePlans`, not a duplicate “What fits here” list.
- Public pages show only `US Eastern → [local range] local`, never a prescribed clock.
- One destination per link. Public copy stays tentative about 2027 hours, fixtures, and conditions.
